OpenOLMS authors and credits.

Author / maintainer:
  Antonio Rico / Ecstasy BBS  (github.com/verta1878)

Clean-room reimplementation of the OLMS offline-mail door. OpenOLMS contains no
code from the original OLMS (Multiboard Communications, shareware); it is written
from published format specifications and the OLMS manual.

Format specifications referenced (their respective authors):
  QWK        - Mark "Sparky" Herring
  QWKE       - community extension spec
  Blue Wave  - Cutting Edge Computing
  JAM        - Joaquim Homrighausen, Andrew Adams, Mats Birch^H Lentz, Mats Wittel
  Hudson     - QuickBBS / RemoteAccess community format
